  "failure_conditions": [
    "Two meeting knots of a tested parity law have non-parallel distinctions, one in each only, with no knot inside their union containing both.",
    "Two non-parallel distinctions joined by a chain of knots lie on no common knot.",
    "The control law of two single clauses has a knot through both far ends."
